msgstr "For trying things out. Every switch is off until you turn it on. With Game speed, Bottomless magazines, Ghost, Bots hold fire, Bots run low on BBs, Spectate any bot, Bot intentions, Time of day or Disable levelling changed, matches don't go into your records."

